<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Paige returns six weeks after starting umeclidinium-vilanterol and eight weeks after starting atorvastatin. He takes the inhaler every morning and has not missed a dose; he has no dry mouth or trouble passing urine. He can now walk to the store without stopping, and uses albuterol two or three times a week. He has been to eight rehabilitation sessions and walks on the days between. He has had no flare-up. His low-dose CT five weeks ago showed emphysema in the upper lobes, a 4 mm nodule with a benign appearance, and calcium in the coronary arteries; he has no chest pain on exertion. He has had no muscle aches on atorvastatin. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>CAT 14, from 18; mMRC 1</td></tr><tr><td>Reliever use</td><td>Two or three times a week</td></tr><tr><td>Low-dose CT</td><td>Centrilobular emphysema; 4 mm nodule, Lung-RADS 2; moderate coronary calcification</td></tr><tr><td>Lipids</td><td>LDL 86 mg/dL, from 148</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.18"/>
    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Less breathless; little morning sputum; no wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, pressure or palpitations on exertion; no ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hesitancy or poor stream</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No muscle aches</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

